@10801 = ~Potemkin Jack the Stinking~
@108011 = ~Raaah! I covered everything up, but there are always pests coming to scavenge in the dustbins.~
@108012 = ~Rex, get rid of this for me.~
@108013 = ~Rex!~
@108014 = ~That mongrel must still be asleep. Oh well, I'll take care of it myself.~
@10802 = ~Rex~
@10803 = ~Roxxie, Rex's companion~
@10804 = ~A pile of debris and broken objects. In some places, it is covered with thick tarps.~
@10805 = ~These rusty arches bear traces of sublime illuminations, erased by time or stained by the rubbing of countless dirty hands.~
@10806 = ~These large tarps cover piles of trash.~
@10807 = ~Something bit you!~
@10808 = ~This large oven is used to burn trash.~
@10809 = ~It looks like someone tried to repair these broken objects, with even worse results.~
@10810 = ~A disgusting leftover meal: a creature you don't recognize, disemboweled, long since rotted and partially moldy.~
@10811 = ~A smashed bed. Clearly something extremely heavy was placed on it.~
@16016 = ~This table and chairs seem recent. They may have been used by vampires; they're the most “alive” things in the area. Someone has carved something into the table with a knife: J.B. 9:12.~

